tables:
  - name: table
    columns:
      - name: mass
        type: number(quantity)
        units: kg
        range: [.nan, 10]
────────────────────────────────────────
error[S12]: Both `range` values must have a place on the number line.
  --> dict.yaml:9:17
   |
LL |   - name: table
LL |     columns:
LL |       - name: mass
LL |         type: number(quantity)
LL |         units: kg
LL |         range: [.nan, 10]
   |                 ^^^^ is `.nan`
   |
   = help: Use `-.inf` or `.inf` to leave that end of the range open.
